      "en": "For you, Lord, are good, and ready to forgive, abundant in loving kindness to all those who call on you.",
      "ko": "주는 선하사 사유하기를 즐기시며 주께 부르짖는 자에게 인자함이 후하심이니이다",
      "source_text_hash": "9124881881ac12a32570f47a3978c743202ea02b56089d21f37b32b6f3f071fa",
      "translation_text_hash": "0c886936335ca5952a0c7e95cc53ea9d8d71920830df8bc2316e92fc7d6a3b94",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
