      "en": "For you are great, and do wondrous things. You are God alone.",
      "ko": "대저 주는 광대하사 기사를 행하시오니 주만 하나님이시니이다",
      "source_text_hash": "c39a5522db21fffe62ff9cfbfac6cdf96df6b87005ba57c3debcc9023fc411ce",
      "translation_text_hash": "72ec6945d869055af95e8c380cae084707b4ae5857adda120b41b25f98aae5df",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
