      "en": "For your loving kindness is great toward me. You have delivered my soul from the lowest Sheol.",
      "ko": "이는 내게 향하신 주의 인자가 크사 내 영혼을 깊은 음부에서 건지셨음이니이다",
      "source_text_hash": "ccade937e77e938776e427531a18dfb03cd7d4a500a2384703c188ff1bfd70a5",
      "translation_text_hash": "efbd6b9cd088f5d201aea8621ae889ed0e03c4c67e415d40dca622506c11d3e7",
